# Communication app status

Updated: 2026-11-13

## Current state

- Django app is registered in `config/settings.py`.
- `/coms/` resolves to the app's `index` view.
- The view delegates to the shared `CORIDE.module_page()` placeholder renderer.
- No chat, review or rating models, real-time messaging, content filtering, or feature tests are implemented.
- Requirements are documented in [05_communication-feedback.md](05_communication-feedback.md).

## Changes so far

- Scaffolded the app with Django's `startapp` command.
- Added the app URL configuration and project route.
- Replaced the generated empty view with a module-specific placeholder.

